# title: SOUL DUEL
# SOUL DUEL sources in compile order, relative to this directory (the engine's come first, see
# engine/MANIFEST). Order matters: macros, structs, components and special variables before their
# users. tuning / rules / control / learn / kit are plain CL (host-tested); yama / ken / rukia / ichigo are the characters
# (data + hooks + cinematics); fighter ... main are the generic systems (no character names, except debug.lisp's test scenarios).
# senjumaru.lisp loads after hud / onehand: its HUD meter calls their functions (hud-text ...); the quad drawing macros are the engine's (ui.lisp), docs/duel/DUEL_SENJUMARU.md.
# lille-art.lisp (Lille's shared art and cinematics), then barro-art.lisp / barro.lisp (Lille, kit :barro, roster index 6:
# index 5 is the removed old Lille's slot, docs/duel/DUEL_LILLE_V3.md) load after senjumaru.lisp: the roster is append-only.
# hisagi.lisp / hisagi-art.lisp (Hisagi, kit :hisagi, roster index 7, docs/duel/DUEL_HISAGI.md) after Lille's.
